      "id": "2120378798977720814",
      "text": "The #FlaPanthers ended a two-game slide with a win against the #CBJ. Sam Bennett scored twice, Jacob Markstrom made 36 saves, and Sam Reinhart passed Jonathan Huberdeau for second on the franchise goals list. Postgame from Paul Maurice, Bennett, Reinhart, and Markstrom ➡️ https://t.co/GeVpZpOicS",
      "url": "https://x.com/GeorgeRichards/status/2120378798977720814",
      "published": "2026-11-11T04:51:15+00:00",
      "likes": 10,
      "author": "George Richards",
      "handle": "GeorgeRichards",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108926375386030080/3Egg9mNu_normal.jpg",
      "media": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW0ZRzOXwAEB5LN.jpg",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120377825299677641",
      "text": "“We’ve got to keep it going and keep building our game.” Markstrom on the mindset following tonight’s win. https://t.co/Paty0jc9uB",
